url: "https://github.com/FILL_IN_USERNAME/literature-collector"
abstract: >-
  Literature Collector is an open-source local-first workspace for academic
  literature management. It unifies multi-database search (OpenAlex, PubMed,
  Semantic Scholar, arXiv), bulk citation extraction from curated review papers,
  duplicate detection, PRISMA-style screening with keyboard shortcuts, and
  formatted Excel export — designed for small research groups that need
  reproducible literature workflows without cloud services.
keywords:
